Subject: 028-add-fast-utxo-shard-sync-protocol: add Fast UTXO Shard Sync
 protocol and Holes 11/13/14/15 defenses

Adds 256-shard Sparse Merkle Tree UTXO download (GETUTXOROOTS, UTXOROOTS,
GETUTXOSHARD, UTXOSHARD), interior branch verification, and unit tests in
fast_sync_shard_tests.cpp.
